      "field": "science",
      "knownFor": "Wrote Silent Spring, which warned about the harm pesticides do",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A marine biologist, she published Silent Spring in 1962, documenting how pesticides such as DDT harm wildlife and people.",
          "source": {
            "name": "American Chemical Society",
            "year": 2012,
            "url": "https://www.acs.org/education/whatischemistry/landmarks/rachel-carson-silent-spring.html"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "The US Environmental Protection Agency banned most uses of DDT in 1972, eight years after her death.",
          "source": {
            "name": "US EPA",
            "year": 1972,
            "url": "https://www.epa.gov/archive/epa/aboutepa/ddt-ban-takes-effect.html"
